Search Document objects by semantic algorithm.

The `filter` field is optional. You can see example into `schema`.

The query vector is computed automatically by the external embeddings service - the client does not pass tokens.

Set `is_reranker_enable` to `true` to rerank the found documents with the external reranker service using the same query.

The `include_extra_fields` field returns additional fields into Document:
 - `chunked_text` - all chunks of document content;
 - `embeddings` - embeddings for each chunk.
